For the most part, these suggestions would make the game easier,
which IMHO is going in the wrong direction.  Do we really want
to be able to make such deadly weapons so easily?
I like the idea of overloading wands, though, as long as
the effect applies to the player as well.  What would overloading
a wand of wishing do, I wonder?
I also like the Boots of Kicking idea, if only because there aren't
enough different types of magic armor.  They should probably also
give you superior kicking ability for normal kicks - set the
MARTIAL flag, at very least.

